    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash out, purge away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνον φόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					1224
				</span></i>
			; of crimes, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				352c
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <i>wash off from oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέποτε ἐκνίψει τὰ πεπραγμένα σαυτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.140
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔθη γυναικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.365
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγος φόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					3.17.7
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θνητόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.499c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνενιμμένοι τόποι</span>”
				<i>washed away,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					POxy.
					1469.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wash clean, purify,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					14.74
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., <i>restore to clarity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν αἴσθησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνενιμμένη,</span> of a cup,
				<i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				56.5
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνιφθεὶς ὁ στόμαχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philum.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.3
			</span></i>.</div>
